Package: maggicpexa
Title: MAGGIC Heart Failure Risk Score - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Stuart J.", "Pocock", role = "ctb",
           comment = "First author of the MAGGIC risk score"))
Description: Implements the published MAGGIC integer risk score for chronic
    heart failure and its lookup table of 1- and 3-year mortality (Pocock et
    al., European Heart Journal 2013 <doi:10.1093/eurheartj/ehs337>): the
    13-variable point chart in Figure 2 and the probabilities in Table 4.
